	(text "Usefull information\n- Default position for whammy is full right and fully pressed is full left\n- Resistance shown next to the button is the mesured value, no a physical resistance\n- Strum Up is D-Pad up\n- Strum Down is D-Pad down\n- Orange is Left Shoulder (LB)\n- Blue is X\n- Yellow is Y\n- Red is B\n- Green is A\n"
